  "title": "Limbach Announces Acquisition of CYMCOR to Strengthen Data Center Services Platform",
  "summary": "TAMPA, Fla. – Limbach Holdings, Inc. (Nasdaq: LMB) (“Limbach,” or the “Company”), a building systems solutions firm that partners with building owners and operators of mission-critical mechanical, electrical, plumbing, and controls (“MEPC”) infrastructure, today announced that it has acquired CYMCOR, Inc. (“CYMCOR”), a professional services firm specializing in program management, commissioning oversight, and strategic consulting […]",
